port: Album, Artist and Online Playlist pages (Phase 3)

Discovery & detail, from the Android side:

- New route `/album` → `lib/screens/detail/album_page.dart` — desktop port of
  `ui/screens/AlbumScreen.kt`: header (artwork, title, artists with links,
  year/track-count/duration), Play + Add-to-library, and the album's songs
  section. "Other versions" / "Releases for you" rows omitted.
- New route `/artist` → `lib/screens/detail/artist_page.dart` — port of
  `ui/screens/artist/ArtistScreen.kt`: header, Play, songs section, and the
  album sections (via `SectionItem`).
- New route `/playlist` → `lib/screens/detail/playlist_page.dart` — port of
  `ui/screens/playlist/OnlinePlaylistScreen.kt` + `BottomPlaylistScreen.kt`:
  header + Play/Shuffle, and the song list.
- `lib/utils/playable.dart` — adapter from YTMusic section items to the
  desktop `MediaPlayer` shape (artists list of {name}, album map).
- `lib/utils/router.dart` — new branches for /album, /artist, /playlist.
- `lib/core/widgets/section_item.dart` — `ItemList` taps now navigate to the
  real detail pages for `type == 'ALBUM'` (`/album`), `'ARTIST'` (`/artist`)
  and `'PLAYLIST'` (`/playlist`), matching Android; previously they pushed the
  generic `/browse`.

Tests: `test/playable_test.dart` (5 cases). Suite total: 18 passing.

Verified: `flutter analyze` 0 errors, `flutter test` all passed,
`flutter build windows --debug` → `echo.exe`, 15 s smoke run clean.
